      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Load one reference photo. The person in it is replaced by the LoRA character.\nPose comes from DWPose of that person (image2), not from the prompt.\nimage1 is the same photo with the person painted out, so her face/hair/body are not copied. The LoRA supplies the new person.\nThe result is pasted onto the original photo, so the background stays sharp.\nCLIP type must be krea2. Check Person hole: white = person, including hair."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
